[gd_resource type="TileSet" load_steps=7 format=3 uid="uid://b8magecitytileset"]

; City / Industrial TileSet for sector_02 (TASK-043, solid-floor fix TASK-046).
; VISUAL ONLY — this TileSet carries NO physics layer; collision remains on the
; sector_02 StaticBody2D nodes (Floor/Ceiling/ledges/BossWall/etc).
;
; TASK-046 root-cause fix: the floor previously skinned every surface with the two
; SEE-THROUGH grate tiles, so the dark parallax showed through the holes and the
; floor never read as solid ground (the hero looked like it stood in mid-air). The
; walkable surfaces are now skinned with SOLID OPAQUE severe-industrial GREY/SLATE
; tiles (matching the lore's grey/teal tone); the grates are retained only as
; optional accent/detail sources.
;
; Atlas source map (Franco Giachetti / Simirk "City / Industrial Platform Tileset"):
;   source 0 = Tile_30 (SOLID dark-slate fill — body/interior/wall, and the ceiling
;                       underside slab so no cap lip points upward)
;   source 1 = Tile_27 (SOLID grey-capped slate — walkable TOP surface of
;                       floor / ledges / boss step; the lighter grey cap band reads
;                       as the ground edge the hero stands ON, full-bleed opaque)
;   source 2 = Tile_88 (grate accent — X-brace grate body, see-through; detail only)
;   source 3 = Tile_85 (grate accent — rail-capped grate, see-through; detail only)
; Native tile is 128x128; the TileMapLayer is scaled 0.5 so each cell = 64 world px.
; Texture filtering stays ON (painterly HD art, not pixel art).

